  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "いきだおれたものの　おんねんが\nこどもが　つくった　すなやまに\nとりつき　たんじょう　したのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "객사한 자의 원통함이\n아이가 만든 모래언덕에\n깃들어 탄생했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "倒斃路邊者的怨念\n附在孩子們堆砌的沙山上\n誕生而成。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est né de la rancœur d’un voyageur\nmort dans l’indifférence, laquelle s’est incarnée\ndans un pâté de sable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Groll eines verstorbenen Reisenden fuhr in\neinen Sandhügel, den ein Kind gebaut hatte,\nund brachte dieses Pokémon in die Welt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgió cuando una persona murió abandonada\nen plena calle y su resentimiento poseyó un\nmontículo de arena apilado por un niño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È nato quando della sabbia ammucchiata da un\nbambino è stata animata dallo spirito risentito di\nun viandante morto da solo durante un viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Born from a sand mound playfully built by a\nchild, this Pokémon embodies the grudges of\nthe departed.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "行き倒れた者の　怨念が\n子どもが　つくった　砂山に\n取りつき　誕生　したのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "倒毙路边者的怨念\n附在孩子们堆砌的沙丘上，\n诞生而成的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgió cuando una persona murió abandonada\nen plena calle y su resentimiento poseyó un\nmontículo de arena apilado por un niño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くちのなかに　てを　いれたものを\nあやつってしまう。　すなやまの\nからだを　おおきく　させるためだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "입안에 손을 넣은 자를\n조종한다. 모래언덕의\n몸집을 크게 만들기 위해서다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了讓沙山的身體變大，\n會操縱把手伸進自己嘴巴者。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ceux qui ont le malheur de mettre la main dans\nsa gueule deviennent ses pantins. Il est prêt à\ntout pour agrandir son corps en forme de dune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann jeden kontrollieren, der seine Hand\nin sein Maul steckt, und bringt sie dann dazu,\nseinen Körper immer weiter zu vergrößern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla a todo aquel que ose meterle la mano\nen la boca. Su objetivo es aumentar el tamaño\nde su cuerpo en forma de duna.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prende il controllo di chiunque gli metta le mani\nnella bocca, servendosi delle vittime per\naccrescere le dimensioni del proprio corpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes control of anyone who puts a hand in its\nmouth. And so it adds to the accumulation of\nits sand-mound body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "口の中に　手を　入れた者を\n操ってしまう。　砂山の\n身体を　大きく　させるためだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "将手伸入其口中就会被其操纵。\n它这样做是为了让沙丘的身体变大。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla a todo aquel que ose meterle la mano\nen la boca. Su objetivo es aumentar el tamaño\nde su cuerpo en forma de duna.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　スコップは　おきにいり。\nとりかえしにきた　こどもと　ケンカ。\nムキに　なって　なぐりあいに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 삽을 마음에 들어한다.\n되찾으러 온 아이와 싸우다가\n열을 올리면서 치고 받고 싸운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "很喜歡頭上的鏟子。\n會和來拿回鏟子的孩子打架，\n打著打著往往會真的互毆起來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il tient beaucoup à la pelle sur sa tête.\nSi un enfant cherche à la récupérer, il se bat\nsans retenir ses coups pour la garder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Schaufel auf seinem Kopf ist sein größter\nSchatz. Versucht ein Kind, sich seine Schaufel\nzurückzuholen, gibt es diese nicht kampflos auf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siente mucho apego por la pala de su cabeza.\nSi un niño intenta quitársela, se enfurece y pelea\npor ella.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È affezionato alla paletta che ha nel capo.\nSe arriva un bambino per riprendersela,\nsi scatena una vera e propria zuffa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It likes the shovel on its head, so Sandygast\nwill get serious and fight any children who come\nto take it back.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　スコップは　お気に入り。\n取り返しに　来た　子どもと　ケンカ。\nムキに　なって　殴り合いに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "很喜欢头上的小铲子,\n会和回来拿的孩子打架。\n互相打着打着就当真了。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siente mucho apego por la pala de su cabeza.\nSi un niño intenta quitársela, se enfurece y pelea\npor ella.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すなあそびで　つくった　すなやまは\nかえるとき　こわさないと　たましいが\nやどり　スナバァに　なるかもしれない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "모래장난으로 만든 모래산은\n돌아갈 때 부수지 않으면 영혼이\n깃들어서 모래꿍이 될지도 모른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "玩沙時堆成的沙山如果沒有\n在回家時破壞掉，就有可能\n被靈魂附上而變成沙丘娃。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Détruisez vos pâtés de sable avant de rentrer\nchez vous, sinon une âme pourrait les posséder\net les transformer en Bacabouh.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lässt man beim Spielen gebaute Sandhaufen\nzurück, kann es vorkommen, dass sich eine\nSeele dort einnistet und ein Sankabuh entsteht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los montículos de arena que los niños no allanan\nantes de irse a casa pueden acabar poseídos\npor un espíritu y convertirse en este Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A fine giornata bisognerebbe disperdere la\nsabbia ammucchiata, altrimenti uno spirito\npotrebbe animarla e generare un Sandygast.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If you build sand mounds when you’re playing,\ndestroy them before you go home, or they\nmay get possessed and become Sandygast.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "砂遊びで　作った　砂山は\n帰るとき　壊さないと　魂が\n宿り　スナバァに　なるかもしれない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
